      "translation" : "[商人]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 48,
      "npc" : "Trader",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hm! You don't have a medical license, do you? It's alright, I've heard about a rogue, unlicensed physician who performed medical miracles! But... That might have been a comic book.",
      "translation" : "嗯！你没有行医执照吧？没关系，我听说过有个非法行医的医生创造过医疗奇迹！不过...也可能是漫画里的情节。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 50,
      "npc" : "Trader",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Trader]",
      "translation" : "[商人]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 51,
      "npc" : "Trader",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Oh whatever. Just don't get caught.",
      "translation" : "随便吧。别被抓到就行。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 56,
      "npc" : "Trader",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Trader]",
      "translation" : "[商人]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 57,
      "npc" : "Trader",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You guy~",
      "translation" : "你这家伙~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 58,
      "npc" : "Trader",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Check the requirements again.",
      "translation" : "再检查一下需求。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 59,
      "npc" : "Trader",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You don't look like an idiot though. So c'mon man, get real.",
      "translation" : "你看起来也不像笨蛋。所以振作点，面对现实吧。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 67,
      "npc" : "Trader",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Trader]",
      "translation" : "[商人]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 68,
      "npc" : "Trader",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Ooh~! You have good fashion sense. I know you've had a hard time collecting this stuff, but this hat is worth it. Take it. All you need now is a fur coat and a cane!",
      "translation" : "哦~！你的时尚品味不错。我知道收集这些东西很辛苦，不过这顶帽子绝对值得。拿去吧。现在你只差一件毛皮大衣和一根手杖了！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 73,
      "npc" : "Trader",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Trader]",
      "translation" : "[商人]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 74,
      "npc" : "Trader",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You guy~",
      "translation" : "你这家伙~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 75,
      "npc" : "Trader",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Go check my requirements again. You don't look like an idiot though. C'mon man, get real.",
      "translation" : "再检查一下我的需求。你看起来也不像笨蛋。振作点，面对现实吧。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 83,
      "npc" : "Trader",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Trader]",
      "translation" : "[商人]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 84,
      "npc" : "Trader",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "This one? It's a little bit scary, though it has some sort of romantic quality. What do you think? You like it? Alright, take it, it's yours!",
      "translation" : "这顶吗？有点吓人，不过也带着些浪漫气息。你觉得呢？喜欢吗？好吧，拿去吧，是你的了！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 89,
      "npc" : "Trader",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Trader]",
      "translation" : "[商人]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 90,
      "npc" : "Trader",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Buffoon. Go check the requirements again. ^3355FFPhantom of Opera^000000 isn't easy to come by. So c'mon man, get real.",
      "translation" : "笨蛋。再检查一下需求。^3355FF歌剧之假面^000000可不容易弄到。振作点，面对现实吧。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 97,
      "npc" : "Trader",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Trader]",
      "translation" : "[商人]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 98,
      "npc" : "Trader",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "If you have a chance to visit the Uplander Village, Payon, please go and meet the Sakkat Craftsman.",
      "translation" : "如果你有机会去普隆德拉的高原村落斐扬，记得去见见笠帽工匠。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 100,
      "npc" : "Trader",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Trader]",
      "translation" : "[商人]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 101,
      "npc" : "Trader",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "He's never sold Sakkat to Traders other than me, since only I can recognize its quality. Due to its rarity, Sakkat has become a very unique and exceptional product. Okay! Take it, it's yours!",
      "translation" : "除了我，他从不把笠帽卖给其他商人，因为只有我懂得鉴别它的品质。由于十分稀有，笠帽成了独特而珍贵的商品。好了！拿去吧，是你的了！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 106,
      "npc" : "Trader",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Trader]",
      "translation" : "[商人]"
    },
