      "npc" : "Trader",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "MORON~ Check my requirements again. C'mon man, you don't look like an idiot, so get real~",
      "translation" : "蠢货~再检查一下需求。振作点，你看起来也不像笨蛋，面对现实吧~"
